    Controls:

    WASD/Arrow
    Keys - Move

    Mouse Move - Look

    Space - Jump

    LMB - Grapple

    RMB
    - Swing

    Left Ctrl - Slide

    Left Shift - Sprint

    R - Reset Level
    (After Death)

    Q - Retry from Checkpoint (After Death)

    E - Switch Level

    Alt
    + F4 - Quit

